Z1     10.540
Y       0.000   3.261
x1      0.000   0.000   3.262
x2      0.000   0.000  -1.117   9.640
Z.int  -5.682   0.000   0.000   0.000 452.021
Z2      0.000   0.000  -0.685   3.881   0.000  28.904

I found it not easy to understand cases like this in lavaan because several factors interact together. I checked the examples several times but If I misunderstood how lavaan behaves, please correct me.

-- Shu Fai

