From u3fe90052fbf2f899 at groups.google.com  Sat Oct  8 06:49:18 2022
From: u3fe90052fbf2f899 at groups.google.com (Terrence Jorgensen)
Date: Sat, 08 Oct 2022 06:49:18 +0000
Subject: Re: Adjust SEM for age, bmi, education
Message-ID: <IMpoCqIZj10.KafLgcKIAAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <IMpoCqIZj10.5makWsKTAAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
