> > > Questions:
> > > 1) Why should I use the standardised solution instead? is it because the SE's I get with parameterEstimates() are not the robust ones? (if this -the second question being a yes- were the case, what would that have to do with the scaling?
> > > 2) Should I therefore also report the SE, pvalues and z-statistics from the standardizedSolution()?
> > >
> > > Thank you!
> > >
> > >
> > > On Thursday, March 31, 2022 at 10:01:21 PM UTC+1 Terrence Jorgensen wrote:
> > > > > standardizedSolution(fit)
> > > > > parameterestimates(fit)
> > > > >
