Subject: Residual covariances in IRT vs. SEM/FA
Message-ID: <KnWxNfePfSI.RCApyQbqAwAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/lavaan/c/KnWxNfePfSI/m/RCApyQbqAwAJ>
