What would be the equivalent of it in other analysis?

The model might be multivariate, but R2 is presented for each outcome (item or construct) in the model. We normally dont present an overall R2, I havent seen such a metric in SEM. You could use the fit indices, as they are effect sizes of the overall model accuracy

