LISREL used to report an overall coefficient of determination for a model. This was a function of all of the R2's for all dependent variables. It was something like 1 - a product of (1 - R2) across all the dependent variables (been a while). I think LISREL stopped reporting it because it was so hard to make sense of it. One particularly high or low value could dramatically color the result.

